WEBVTT

00:11:28.733 --> 00:11:34.391
♪ makes me feel ugly ♪ 
(membuatku merasa jelek)

00:11:34.391 --> 00:11:37.465
♪ So much shame ♪ 
(Aku sangat malu)

00:11:43.595 --> 00:11:47.296
♪ And I'd like to know ♪ 
(Dan aku ingin tahu)

00:11:47.296 --> 00:11:50.852
♪ Are there stars in hell ♪ 
(Apakah ada bintang di neraka)

00:11:50.852 --> 00:11:54.624
♪ And I'd like to know ♪ 
(Dan aku ingin tahu)

00:11:54.624 --> 00:11:58.282
♪ know if you can tell ♪ 
(apakah kamu tahu)

00:11:58.282 --> 00:12:02.123
♪ that you make me lose ♪
(bahwa kamu membuatku)